100	/* Serializes claim/release of s_ctx — and the s_last idempotency cache — across
101	 * tasks. hnd_commission_post spawns a cm_worker PER request, so two
102	 * near-simultaneous /commission requests race the "already in progress"
103	 * check-and-set without this: both pass, driving two concurrent PairDevice()
104	 * calls on one commissioner and orphaning the losing ctx (its 120 s waiter
105	 * hands teardown to a finish() that can never see it → permanent leak).
106	 * Static-buffer mutex, created at boot by flux_commission_init() — creation
107	 * cannot fail and no lazy-init TOCTOU. Never held across blocking work: only
108	 * around the pointer check-and-set / clear and the s_last copies. */
109	SemaphoreHandle_t s_claim_mux = nullptr;
110	StaticSemaphore_t s_claim_mux_buf;
