 * Mirrors the host-verified flux_ice_bridge_bsd.c: a FreeRTOS reader task pumps
 * the loopback socket into flux_ice_send(); inbound app data arrives via
 * flux_ice_bridge_deliver() and is written back to the loopback peer
 * (127.0.0.1:5684 = libcoap). Same API (flux_ice_udp.h).
 *
 * NOT host-buildable — compiled only by the flux-controller IDF component
 * (needs FreeRTOS + lwIP). Logic tracks the BSD variant, which IS host-tested
 * (test_connect_bridge); this file has not yet been built on-target. Resource
 * budget + interface isolation: flux-controller ADR-0004.
 */
