 * -> libjuice agent_send -> conn_send -> lwIP sendto on THIS task's stack. With
 * a 4 KiB stack the first outbound packet (the controller's DTLS ServerHello
 * relayed back to the app) overflowed it. 12 KiB gave the libjuice + lwIP send
 * chain comfortable headroom — but only for a DIRECT (host/srflx) path.
 *
